L2-ARCTIC-derived artifacts
---------------------------

The MIT License above applies to original software and documentation in this
repository. It does not relicense the following artifacts derived from the
L2-ARCTIC corpus:

- src/pronunciation_coach/data/phone_policy.v1.json
- benchmarks/manifests/l2arctic-speakers-v1.json
- benchmarks/reports/l2arctic-integrity-v1.json
- benchmarks/reports/l2arctic-phone-calibration-v1.json
- benchmarks/reports/l2arctic-phone-final-v1.json
- benchmarks/reports/l2arctic-speechocean-regression-v1.json

These artifacts are distributed for non-commercial use under the L2-ARCTIC
corpus terms, Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Required attribution:

